{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000026215","bookName":"La bendición que perdieron","cover":"","viewCount":189569,"followCount":8394,"introduction":"Sara, la sagrada bestia Kirin, agradecida al anciano Toro por protegerla de la lluvia, le dio una perla mágica y un deseo. Años después, Daniel, hijo del anciano, suplicó un heredero ante la estatua de Kirin con la perla. Sara la convirtió en Perla de Fertilidad, la llevó al pecho y canalizó energía fértil a Laura, la nuera, quien quedó embarazada de un varón. Daniel la colmó de atenciones, pero Laura, creyéndola hija ilegítima, comenzó a actuar contra ella.","chapterCount":50,"labels":["Forbidden Love","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Forbidden Love","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[10136],"typeTwoNames":["Buff"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":10136,"name":"Buff","replaceName":"buff"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Buff","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-bendición-que-perdieron","bookNameLower":"la-bendición-que-perdieron","shelfTime":"2026-08-31 00:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-31 00:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"22385","performerName":"Jinbao Wang","performerFormatName":"Jinbao-Wang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x8/22385/22385.jpg?time=1787905959353","videoCount":0},{"performerId":"29047","performerName":"Zujing Li","performerFormatName":"Zujing-Li","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x4/29047/29047.jpg?time=1787905961441","videoCount":0}],"performerIdList":[22385,29047]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701548896","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":164929,"price":0},{"id":"701548897","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":191936,"price":0},{"id":"701548898","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":204971,"price":0},{"id":"701548899","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":148886,"price":0},{"id":"701548900","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":140160,"price":0},{"id":"70